ing approach to sequencing problems”, Journal of SIAM 10, 1962): the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"least-weight Hamiltonian cycle of the simple graph, or nil when there is none; among the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"optimal ones, the lexicographically least by vertex number listed from the first vertex"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(JGraphT "},{"code":"HeldKarpTSP","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"’s tour). The graph need not be complete: a missing pair is an absent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edge. Tours read the simple graph, as "},{"code":"nearestNeighborTour(weight:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" documents; nil below"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"three vertices."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/tours\/graphprotocols\/graph\/shortesttour(weight:)"]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/shortestTour(weight:)"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours","doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"Tours"}],"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5ToursE12shortestTour6weight5Walks5CycleVy6VertexQz5Edges_5IndexQZGSgqd__ANXE_ts18AdditiveArithmeticRd__SLRd__lF","remoteSource":{"fileName":"HeldKarp.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Tours\/HeldKarp.swift#L186"},"title":"shortestTour(weight:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"shortestTour","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"W","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"}